==Strategy==
2 Sm "Research" Effect UP [[Cat Combo|Combos]] or an M "Research" Effect UP Combo with any lineup including these 4 units—[[Ramen Cat]], [[Dark Lazer]], [[Pizza Cat]] and [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Master of Mind Catcrates]]—absolutely destroy this stage! There's plenty of cash to go around here, so feel free to add any other unit to assist you if you think your cats aren't enough strong by themselves.

