==Trivia==
*Pollution Isolation's Japanese name stands out from the others in [[Secluded Cavy Island]] in that it arguably has more to do with magic than science. The name Kodoku ga Umu Kodoku (蠱毒が生む孤独, "Kodoku-induced Loneliness") refers to ''[https://www.abracademica.com/l/kodoku-japanese-witchcraft/ kodoku]'' (蠱毒, "curse poison"), a type of witchcraft performed by arranging various insects inside a jar, waiting for them to kill each other until only one remains, and using the sole survivor or its fluids to lay a harmful curse on someone.
*Pollution Isolation is the only stage in Secluded Cavy Island to have no [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]].

